      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "DiT360 / FLUX - VAE Conv2d Circular Padding (X-only)\\n\\nGoal: reduce seam introduced during VAE decode, without changing the diffusion sampling.\\n\\nHow it works:\\n- ApplyCircularPaddingVAE patches Conv2d layers inside your loaded VAE to use circular padding on X (width) and zero padding on Y.\\n\\nImportant:\\n- If you use ApplyCircularPaddingVAE, set Equirect360VAEDecode.circular_padding = 0 (avoid double-padding).\\n- Start with Equirect360KSampler.circular_padding = 0 (add later only if needed)."
      ],
      "color": "#263",
      "bgcolor": "#385"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "Note",
